.SH NAME
coverage\-audit\-support \- CI support subcommands for the audit pipeline
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B coverage\-audit\-support SUBCOMMAND
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Support commands are separate from the offline auditor CLI and run in CI: fetch downloads the public source snapshot, callback reports run provenance, privacy scans the checkout for private data, bundle writes the result manifest, badges writes metric badge endpoints, and summary renders the run summary. Each takes exactly one subcommand name as its only argument.
